## P2 — Rider slice (specs-mobile §20 step 10; read-and-claim only)

Role note (DESIGN §0.4): the rider is the **courier terminal** — highest
density, 56 primary / 48 secondary targets, glanceable ≤2 s screens,
`wght` 600 icons. Speed-based §14 rules (moving lockout, stop-precondition
timers) are inapplicable without a ping RPC (out of v1, §13) — enforced
preconditions are geofence + explicit `I AM ON FOOT` where the contract
provides coordinates; the limitation is recorded, not worked around.

